WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.627
You ready for this, Aniston?

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:03.628
I’m ready, bubbe.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:05.046
Okay, let's go.

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:05.547
Let's go.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.550
What is Adam Sandler's
favorite color, do you know?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.926
Fluorescent orange.

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:10.760
I do like that.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.511
You love that color.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.095
You know why?

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:12.595
Why?

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.805
Orange crush soda.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:14.973
Always loved that.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.307
I didn't know that part.

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.350
Now I know that part.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.893
When did you and I first meet?

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.478
I know when that happened.

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:21.104
Do you?

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.230
Of course I do.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:26.234
We were young at Jerry's Deli,
and we had breakfast together.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.236
You had eggs with ham and cheese.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.487
And what did I have?

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:30.447
French toast?

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.865
And I washed it down with?

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.200
Oh oh, chocolate milk.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.369
Like a grown man should.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:36.953
Boom.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:38.997
What's my go-to condiment?

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:39.873
I know what you love.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.457
What?

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.666
Raw onions.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.959
Old mustard.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:46.004
Relish and some chopped up fingernails.

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:50.008
First of all, I've never
ordered a hot dog in your presence.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:52.635
I love. Well, my favorite mayonnaise.

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:53.970
You love mayonnaise?

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.138
That's good stuff.

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.057
Well, when's Jen's birthday?

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:57.932
You would know that one.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:58.808
I kind of know that.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:00:59.851
February 11th.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:00.769
Let me go.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:01.895
When's my birthday?

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.021
February 11th.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.522
Hey-ho!

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:05.398
Hey!

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.484
Adam's favorite type of chair?

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:09.152
Oh, gosh.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.445
A Barcalounger?

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.696
I'm sorry.

00:01:11.696 --> 00:01:12.989
Do you have a weird chair?

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.115
You're just happy to sit.

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.200
Yeah, it's fun to sit.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.285
I'll take a floor. The floor is fine.

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:19.954
What's my favorite yoga pose?

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:20.830
Oh, that's easy.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.165
Downward mayonnaise.

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.251
Do yourself a favor if you want to laugh.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:27.712
Murder Mystery 2.

